  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica\">(20 fotos) Lorena Castellar Ortiz, con Morri&ntilde;a, ha ganado el premio general para personas adultas del II concurso de cuentos de Navidad, organizado por el Ayuntamiento de Ribesalbes. Laura Cabedo Mor, con La can&ccedil;&oacute; dels absents, ha ganado la categor&iacute;a en valenciano.</font></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/02/IMG_1260.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica\">En esta &uacute;ltima categor&iacute;a ha habido dos acc&eacute;sits para Javier Le&oacute;n Sorrribes, por sus relatos Un pare Noel d&#39;altre planeta y Cinc de Gener.</font> <font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica\">El primer premio infantil ha sido para Joel Vicent Mor, por Una nit de Nadal,</font><font color=\"#1d2129\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><font face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><font style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\"> mientras que la ni&ntilde;a Irene Sim&oacute; Iserte ha obtenido una acc&eacute;sit con I&middot;lusi&oacute; per Nadal.</font></font></font></p>\n<p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 13.33px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">El jurado estaba compuesto por el alcalde de Ribesalbes, C&eacute;sar Pallar&eacute;s Torres, la concejala de Cultura, Thais Montolio Bachero, y la responsable de la agencia de lectura, Pili Ballester Gil.&nbsp;<span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 13.33px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">Tuvieron que dilucidar entre los 78 cuentos presentados.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisnarrativabibliotecaribesalbes/img_1235.jpg\" alt=\"img_1235\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisnarrativabibliotecaribesalbes/img_1236.jpg\" alt=\"img_1236\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisnarrativabibliotecaribesalbes/img_1239.jpg\" alt=\"img_1239\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisnarrativabibliotecaribesalbes/img_1240.jpg\" alt=\"img_1240\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisnarrativabibliotecaribesalbes/img_1241.jpg\" alt=\"img_1241\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisnarrativabibliotecaribesalbes/img_1242.jpg\" alt=\"img_1242\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisnarrativabibliotecaribesalbes/img_1244.jpg\" alt=\"img_1244\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisnarrativabibliotecaribesalbes/img_1245.jpg\" alt=\"img_1245\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisnarrativabibliotecaribesalbes/img_1247.jpg\" alt=\"img_1247\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisnarrativabibliotecaribesalbes/img_1248.jpg\" alt=\"img_1248\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisnarrativabibliotecaribesalbes/img_1250.jpg\" alt=\"img_1250\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisnarrativabibliotecaribesalbes/img_1251.jpg\" alt=\"img_1251\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisnarrativabibliotecaribesalbes/img_1253.jpg\" alt=\"img_1253\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisnarrativabibliotecaribesalbes/img_1254.jpg\" alt=\"img_1254\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisnarrativabibliotecaribesalbes/img_1255.jpg\" alt=\"img_1255\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisnarrativabibliotecaribesalbes/img_1257.jpg\" alt=\"img_1257\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisnarrativabibliotecaribesalbes/img_1260.jpg\" alt=\"img_1260\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisnarrativabibliotecaribesalbes/img_1264.jpg\" alt=\"img_1264\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisnarrativabibliotecaribesalbes/img_1265.jpg\" alt=\"img_1265\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4